I read all of the books once a year.&nbsp;
I know so much more than you do.

00:00:27.600 --> 00:00:29.120
We’ll start with Harry’s infancy.

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.640
Oh, f—.

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:37.468
It is a dark time for Wizard kind, as the evil&nbsp;
lord Voldemort has become what sorcerers refer to as a Jerk McGurk.

00:00:37.468 --> 00:00:39.680
Ah yes, the Jerk McGurk who must not be named.&nbsp;

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:44.240
A prophecy states that Voldemort&nbsp;
will be defeated by some kid -

00:00:44.240 --> 00:00:45.280
Oversimplification.

00:00:45.280 --> 00:00:49.280
So he decides to kill baby&nbsp;
Harry by feeding him to a snake.

00:00:49.280 --> 00:00:50.080
Nope.

00:00:50.080 --> 00:00:51.520
By chucking him out a window.

00:00:51.520 --> 00:00:52.141
No.

00:00:52.141 --> 00:00:54.960
By un-baby proofing the Potter house&nbsp;
and letting him toddle into corners.

00:00:54.960 --> 00:00:56.320
No, he uses magic.

