Tournament is not the magic Olympics.

00:02:27.440 --> 00:02:28.560
Okay, what would you compare it to?

00:02:28.560 --> 00:02:32.080
It’s more like the wizard NCAA, only there’s&nbsp;
a chance that the athletes might actually get paid.
 &nbsp;

00:02:32.080 --> 00:02:35.200
Got it. Anyway, Harry watches as Ron’s old pet rat&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:35.200 --> 00:02:39.360
