He turns him into a Grave Diggor-y.

00:02:43.080 --> 00:02:44.080
UGH

00:02:44.080 --> 00:02:47.280
Into Deadric Grave Diggory Dead Murder Dead

00:02:47.280 --> 00:02:48.061
Please Stop.

00:02:48.061 --> 00:02:51.920
Voldemort comes back, first as an angry little&nbsp;
baby then as a long, white jelly bean.

00:02:51.920 --> 00:02:52.651
Great.

00:02:52.651 --> 00:02:56.240
In year five, Harry learns that government&nbsp;
oversight is bad and that starting a fight&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:56.240 --> 00:02:58.080
club at school is good. Meanwhile,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:02:58.080 --> 00:03:02.240
Voldemort hears the first half of a prophecy&nbsp;
