00:03:02.240 --> 00:03:05.200
so he gaslights Harry into&nbsp;
visiting a snowglobe factory.

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.360
Yeah… wait, what?

00:03:07.360 --> 00:03:11.280
And then Harry finds out that he’s half&nbsp;
dracula, but then my dad shows up and&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:03:11.280 --> 00:03:15.280
he's all like "You’re the reason your mom left.”&nbsp;
Then after that Pete Davidson takes his pants...

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:15.500
Tom.

00:03:15.680 --> 00:03:16.000
